# Shared secret for Dovecot's doveadm HTTP API (127.0.0.1-only within the
# mail_justu_network, never published to the host) -- lets api/ query
# per-mailbox storage usage (doveadm mailboxStatus) without needing the
# Docker socket or a copy of each user's IMAP password. See the
# dovecot_config volume's `DOVEADM_PASSWORD = %{env:DOVEADM_PASSWORD |
# default}` for how this is consumed.
# This is the one place to edit it -- setup.sh syncs .env/api.env's copy
# from here automatically.
# >>> change: regenerate for a new server
DOVEADM_PASSWORD=767a1898fa53d04b00a63d56ef9f806e9fbc40c4487f070f
